🚨BIG NEWS for our racetracks and bettors

@WaysandMeansGOP under the great leadership of @RepJasonSmith advanced a version of my WAGER Act to ensure bettors are taxed on what they actually make, NOT winnings entirely wiped out by losses.

This fix protects bettors, our tracks, and their purses. I’ll keep fighting to get it done.
